&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(52, 73, 94);&quot;&gt;NB - these roles are high priority - therefore we are prioritisitng candidates who can commence employment in the next 2 weeks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
