&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience leading technical direction, making architectural decisions, and solving complex engineering problems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep expertise in software engineering, architecture, testing, reliability, performance, and maintainable system design.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to connect technical decisions to customer and business outcomes while balancing delivery with long-term technical health.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence and Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong communication skills with the ability to build consensus, influence across teams, and explain technical concepts to non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentoring and Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; A strong track record of developing engineers, working effectively with EMs and wider engineering communities, and contributing to a culture of learning and excellence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Key Technologies.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We ask for expertise in some, and the willingness to learn where required&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud Platforms&lt;/strong&gt;: AWS and GCP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
