&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Frameworks&lt;/strong&gt;: Vue.js, Django Rest Framework, Container-based and Serverless architectures&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
